# Shared agent documents and local secret protection
# Shared document and sensitive-file rules used by the root .gitignore.
# The rules below include specific shared files and their parent directories.
# Do not replace these exact exceptions with broad recursive inclusion patterns.
# Existing custom secret exclusions still apply to other files in these folders.

!/.agents/
!/.github/
!/docs/
!/.agents/skills/
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
!/docs/agent-logs/
!/docs/agent-tools/
!/docs/retrospectives/
